  "entry": "code/README.md",
  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). Open Bio-Rad CFX (.zpcr/.pcrd/.plt.csv) or Biomeme (.bmrun) run files in the browser and look at amplification and melt curves, Cq/Tm values, the thermal protocol as run, the plate layout, optical reference and calibration data, and the raw archive entries. Data used in the run: example. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
